{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"Yeah. I got home that day really tired. It turned out an aunt of mine had come down from the mainland, so we went out to eat."}],"id":"1f32dfb2491dfe18","jyutping":"hai6 aa3。go2 jat6 faan1 dou3 uk1 kei2，dou1 hou2 gui6 laa3。gan1 zyu6 jyun4 loi4 ngo5 jau5 go3 gu1 maa1 hai2 daai6 luk6 lok6 zo2 lai4。gan1 zyu6 zau6 heoi3 zo2 sik6 faan6。","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"係啊。嗰日返到屋企，都好攰嚹。跟住原來我有個姑媽喺大陸落咗來。跟住就去咗食飯。","words":[{"jyutping":"hai6","pos":"v","text":"係"},{"jyutping":"aa3","pos":"y","text":"啊"},{"jyutping":"go2","pos":"r","text":"嗰"},{"jyutping":"jat6","pos":"q","text":"日"},{"jyutping":"faan1","pos":"v","text":"返"},{"jyutping":"dou3","pos":"u","text":"到"},{"jyutping":"uk1 kei2","pos":"n","text":"屋企"},{"jyutping":"dou1","pos":"d","text":"都"},{"jyutping":"hou2","pos":"d","text":"好"},{"jyutping":"gui6","pos":"a","text":"攰"},{"jyutping":"laa3","pos":"y","text":"嚹"},{"jyutping":"gan1 zyu6","pos":"c","text":"跟住"},{"jyutping":"jyun4 loi4","pos":"d","text":"原來"},{"jyutping":"ngo5","pos":"r","text":"我"},{"jyutping":"jau5","pos":"v1","text":"有"},{"jyutping":"go3","pos":"q","text":"個"},{"jyutping":"gu1 maa1","pos":"n","text":"姑媽"},{"jyutping":"hai2","pos":"p","text":"喺"},{"jyutping":"daai6 luk6","pos":"ns","text":"大陸"},{"jyutping":"lok6","pos":"v","text":"落"},{"jyutping":"zo2","pos":"u","text":"咗"},{"jyutping":"lai4","pos":"v","text":"來"},{"jyutping":"gan1 zyu6","pos":"c","text":"跟住"},{"jyutping":"zau6","pos":"d","text":"就"},{"jyutping":"heoi3","pos":"v","text":"去"},{"jyutping":"zo2","pos":"u","text":"咗"},{"jyutping":"sik6 faan6","pos":"v","text":"食飯"}]}
